    "prompt": "The roc_curve function currently computes an extra threshold value using the expression 'max(y_score) + 1' to ensure the ROC curve starts at (0,0). However, when y_score represents probability estimates, this approach can result in threshold values that exceed 1, which is inconsistent with the expected probability range. The goal is to update the implementation so that the initial threshold is set to np.inf, thereby guaranteeing that the thresholds remain within the proper bounds. This fix also requires updating the function\u2019s documentation and inline comments to clearly communicate the new behavior.",
